						"tag": "@file",
						"content": [
							{
								"kind": "code",
								"text": "`@anvilkit/core/testing/editor`"
							},
							{
								"kind": "text",
								"text": " — fixture builders and\ncontract assertion helpers for the visual editor (DD-0019 §22.2;\nPLAN-0020 CORE-P0-017).\n\nThe builders generate documents at the frozen §7.3 count limits,\nlegacy documents without a sidecar, unknown-version sidecars, and\na root config with slot fields (the invariant-11 fixture). The\nassertion helpers encode the single-intent history rule and the\ncontent-free event privacy contract so every suite checks them the\nsame way. The compatibility suite in "
							},
							{
								"kind": "code",
								"text": "`__tests__/`"
							},
							{
								"kind": "text",
								"text": " is the\nregression net for the \"reader only\" rollout stage (§30.7)."
							}
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"signatures": [
				{
					"id": 2,
					"name": "assertContentFreeEvent",
					"variant": "signature",
					"kind": 4096,
					"flags": {},
					"comment": {
						"summary": [
							{
								"kind": "text",
								"text": "Assert an operational event is content-free (DD-0019 §22.4): only\nthe schema-declared keys are present, and no string value looks\nlike a URL or free text beyond identifier length."
							}
						]
					},
					"parameters": [
						{
							"id": 3,
							"name": "event",
							"variant": "param",
							"kind": 32768,
							"flags": {},
							"type": {
